    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_cross_border_travel_resolution_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-cross-border-travel-resolution-01",
        "title": "Cross-Border Travel Disruption & Multi-Party Resolution: part 1",
        "setting": "professional workshop",
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "transport",
        "characters": [
          "Nora",
          "Samir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "How would you respond without making the disagreement personal?",
            "translation_fa": "چطور جواب می‌دادی بدون اینکه مخالفت شخصی بشه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Samir",
            "text": "The fastest rerouting is not useful if the operating carrier cannot honor the ticket under the current agreement.",
            "translation_fa": "سریع‌ترین مسیر جایگزین وقتی فایده نداره که شرکت اجراکننده طبق توافق فعلی نتونه بلیت رو قبول کنه."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "What could you concede while still holding your position?",
            "translation_fa": "چی رو می‌تونی بپذیری و در عین حال موضعت رو حفظ کنی؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Samir",
            "text": "I need to separate operational help from liability; the desk assisting me may not be the party responsible for reimbursement.",
            "translation_fa": "باید کمک عملیاتی رو از مسئولیت مالی جدا کنم؛ میزی که کمکم می‌کنه شاید مسئول بازپرداخت نباشه."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_cross_border_travel_resolution_scene_2",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-cross-border-travel-resolution-02",
        "title": "Cross-Border Travel Disruption & Multi-Party Resolution: part 2",
        "setting": "strategy meeting",
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "transport",
        "characters": [
          "Elena",
          "Marcus"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Elena",
            "text": "What do you make of the way this is being framed?",
            "translation_fa": "از نحوه مطرح شدن این موضوع چه برداشتی داری؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Marcus",
            "text": "I am keeping every receipt and written refusal because documentation matters if the claim later moves to formal review.",
            "translation_fa": "همه رسیدها و ردهای کتبی رو نگه می‌دارم چون اگر پرونده به بازبینی رسمی برسه مدارک مهم می‌شن."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Elena",
            "text": "Is there another interpretation we should keep in view?",
            "translation_fa": "تفسیر دیگه‌ای هست که باید در نظر داشته باشیم؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Marcus",
            "text": "My entitlement may depend on the cause of the disruption, the route and which carrier actually operated the affected segment.",
            "translation_fa": "حق من ممکنه به علت اختلال، مسیر و اینکه کدوم شرکت واقعاً بخش آسیب‌دیده رو اجرا کرده بستگی داشته باشه."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_c2_cross_border_travel_resolution_scene_3",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c2-cross-border-travel-resolution-03",
        "title": "Cross-Border Travel Disruption & Multi-Party Resolution: part 3",
        "setting": "seminar break",
        "cefr": "C2",
        "topic": "transport",
        "characters": [
          "Hana",
          "Luis"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Hana",
            "text": "Which assumption is doing most of the work here?",
            "translation_fa": "کدوم فرض بیشترین نقش رو در این استدلال داره؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Luis",
            "text": "Because the itinerary crosses jurisdictions, the applicable passenger rights may not be determined by the departure country alone.",
            "translation_fa": "چون مسیر از چند حوزه قضایی رد می‌شه، حقوق مسافر لزوماً فقط با کشور مبدأ تعیین نمی‌شه."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Hana",
            "text": "How would the conclusion change if that assumption failed?",
            "translation_fa": "اگر اون فرض برقرار نباشه نتیجه چطور عوض می‌شه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
            "speaker": "Luis",
            "text": "An interline agreement can solve ticketing logistics without making the second carrier responsible for the original delay.",
            "translation_fa": "توافق بین شرکت‌ها می‌تونه مشکل بلیت رو حل کنه بدون اینکه شرکت دوم مسئول تأخیر اولیه بشه."
          }
        ],
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
